{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/services/layout,_N_T_/services/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/services/[slug]/page,_N_T_/services/lead-capture"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/services/$d$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}}},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/e6e9967145347c46d06f7c18cbc7593f023a0f464c96986256200139a67eed49/$/services/lead-capture","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/services/[slug]/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2cxb684axw7o7.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/19mx3mg6lkumu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3g4px251sg85e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2z-e6jheq0ftu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-03rfayxv7ep_b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3jnihsg-rcdh1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/24z92xz7r4i_p.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Lead Capture &amp; Follow-Up Setup in Jackson, MS | The Sip Web Studio</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Estimate forms, lead logs, and inquiry acknowledgments for busy local service businesses that want a more organized response process.\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/services/lead-capture\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Lead Capture &amp; Follow-Up Setup | The Sip Web Studio\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Estimate forms, lead logs, and inquiry acknowledgments for busy local service businesses that want a more organized response process.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/services/lead-capture\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"The Sip Web Studio | Jackson, MS Web Design\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Practical websites and business technology for Mississippi businesses.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/social-card.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1xagt9q099n52.ico\" sizes=\"48x48\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/studio-icon.svg\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to content</a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"wrap nav\"><a class=\"wordmark\" aria-label=\"The Sip Web Studio home\" href=\"/\">the sip<span>WEB STUDIO</span></a><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/services\">Services</a><a href=\"/#portfolio\">Work</a><a href=\"/#about\">About</a><a href=\"/#pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"/#contact\">Free growth review ↗</a></nav></div></header><main id=\"main-content\"><section class=\"section wrap\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/services\">Services</a><span>/</span><span>Lead Capture &amp; Follow-Up Setup</span></nav><div class=\"service-hero\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Lead Capture &amp; Follow-Up Setup<!-- --> · Jackson, MS</p><h1>Keep a good inquiry from getting lost.</h1><p class=\"lead\">Estimate forms, lead logs, and inquiry acknowledgments for busy local service businesses that want a more organized response process.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"#service-contact\">Get a free business growth review ↗</a></div></div><aside class=\"service-price\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Your starting point</p><p class=\"price\">$399</p><p>one-time setup</p><p>We agree on the fields, destination, and acknowledgment before connecting and testing the workflow.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#included\">See what’s included ↓</a></aside></div><div class=\"case-grid\"><h2>Is this a good fit?</h2><p>For owners juggling calls, texts, and website messages without a reliable place to track who needs a reply.</p></div><div id=\"included\" class=\"case-grid\"><h2>What you get</h2><ul class=\"deliverables\"><li>One estimate or inquiry form tailored to your service</li><li>Email notification to your business</li><li>Basic lead log with inquiry details</li><li>One automated customer acknowledgment</li><li>Clear next-step messaging</li><li>End-to-end testing and handoff</li></ul></div><div class=\"case-grid\"><h2>In everyday terms</h2><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Illustrative example</p><p>A homeowner requests driveway cleaning. Their service details go into a lead log, the business gets an email, and the homeowner receives confirmation that the request was received.</p></div></div><div class=\"case-grid\"><h2>A clear scope</h2><div><p>Starting scope covers one form and one acknowledgment workflow. CRM connections, SMS, multi-step follow-ups, subscriptions, and messaging usage are additional. Your team still handles estimates and customer responses.</p><p>Before work begins, you receive a written scope covering deliverables, account access, revisions, payment milestones, and support. You keep ownership of your domain and business accounts.</p></div></div><section class=\"demo-section\" aria-labelledby=\"demo-title\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Try the inquiry system · Interactive demo</p><h2 id=\"demo-title\">From request to <em>ready to reply.</em></h2><p>Use fictional details to see how a customer request becomes an organized lead. This demo runs only in your browser. It sends no messages and saves no data.</p><div class=\"contact-grid\"><form class=\"contact-form\"><label>Example customer name<input required=\"\" maxLength=\"80\" name=\"demo-name\" value=\"Jamie Smith\"/></label><label>Service needed<select name=\"demo-service\"><option>Driveway pressure washing</option><option>Lawn maintenance</option><option>Home repair estimate</option></select></label><button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\">Simulate estimate request →</button></form><div class=\"demo-dashboard\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Example owner dashboard</p><h3>Your next inquiry, organized.</h3><p>Submit the example request to preview the workflow.</p></div></div><p class=\"small\">A client installation connects your real form, lead destination, and approved notification tools. Software and messaging fees are separate.</p></section><div class=\"case-grid\"><h2>A few good questions</h2><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Can you use my current website?</summary><p>Usually. We first check whether the platform supports the required form and integration.</p></details><details><summary>Will it automatically send a quote?</summary><p>The basic setup confirms receipt. Automated pricing requires separate rules and a custom scope.</p></details></div></div><div class=\"service-related\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Keep exploring</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/review-request-system\">Review Request System<!-- --> ↗</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services\">All services ↗</a></div></section><section id=\"service-contact\" class=\"section contact-section\"><div class=\"wrap contact-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Let’s find your next step</p><h2>Start with a<br/><em>free growth review.</em></h2><p>Tell me about your business and the problem you want to solve. I’ll review your online presence or workflow and suggest a practical next step, with no obligation to buy.</p><a class=\"text-link email-link\" href=\"mailto:thesipsoftwaresolutions@gmail.com\">thesipsoftwaresolutions@gmail.com ↗</a></div><form class=\"contact-form\"><div class=\"form-row\"><label>Your name<input autoComplete=\"name\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"First and last name\" maxLength=\"120\" name=\"name\"/></label><label>Email address<input type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"you@yourbusiness.com\" maxLength=\"254\" name=\"email\"/></label></div><label>Business name<input autoComplete=\"organization\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"What’s your business called?\" maxLength=\"180\" name=\"business\"/></label><label>Service of interest<select name=\"service\"><option>Not sure — free growth review</option><option>Website Design &amp; Development</option><option>Business Growth System</option><option>Google Business Profile Setup &amp; Optimization</option><option>Local SEO &amp; Visibility</option><option selected=\"\">Lead Capture &amp; Follow-Up Setup</option><option>Review Request System</option><option>Appointment &amp; Booking Automation</option><option>Business Workflow Automation</option><option>AI Solutions for Small Businesses</option><option>Custom Business Systems</option><option>Monthly Website Care &amp; Local Growth</option><option>Hosting &amp; Website Performance</option></select></label><label>Current website (optional)<input maxLength=\"500\" placeholder=\"Your website or business profile link\" name=\"website\"/></label><label>What would you like to improve?<textarea name=\"message\" required=\"\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Tell me about your services, where you work, and what you want to make easier.\" maxLength=\"3000\"></textarea></label><button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\">Draft my free review request ↗</button><p class=\"small\">This opens a draft in your email app. Send it there to complete your inquiry. You can also email me directly.</p></form></div></section><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Lead Capture & Follow-Up Setup\",\"description\":\"Estimate forms, lead logs, and inquiry acknowledgments for busy local service businesses that want a more organized response process.\",\"url\":\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/services/lead-capture\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/#studio\"},\"areaServed\":[\"Jackson, MS\",\"Madison, MS\",\"Ridgeland, MS\",\"Brandon, MS\",\"Flowood, MS\",\"Pearl, MS\",\"Clinton, MS\"]}</script></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"wrap footer\"><a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"/\">the sip<span>WEB STUDIO</span></a><p>Thoughtfully built in Mississippi.<br/><a href=\"/services\">Explore services</a> · <a href=\"/services/google-business-profile#disclosure\">Google profile disclosure</a></p><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> The Sip Web Studio</p></footer><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/#studio\",\"name\":\"The Sip Web Studio\",\"url\":\"https://thesipwebstudio.com\",\"email\":\"thesipsoftwaresolutions@gmail.com\",\"areaServed\":[\"Jackson, Mississippi\",\"Ridgeland, Mississippi\",\"Madison, Mississippi\",\"Flowood, Mississippi\",\"Brandon, Mississippi\",\"Pearl, Mississippi\",\"Clinton, Mississippi\"],\"description\":\"Independent website and business technology studio serving Jackson and Mississippi businesses.\",\"hasOfferCatalog\":{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Small business technology services\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Web design and development\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Local SEO\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Website maintenance\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Hosting\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Google Business Profile optimization\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Lead capture and follow-up\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Review request systems\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Appointment automation\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":